hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16","[AI-translation] Mke mwadilifu wa Uthman ibn Maz'un, Khawlah bint Hakim (Allah amridhie), anasimulia: Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) alitoka pamoja na Hasan na Husayn (Allah awaridhie wawili) akasema: ((Watoto ni sababu ya ubakhili na uoga)). Na mara nyingine akasema: Nimemuona Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) akisema: ((Na hakika nyinyi hufanya ubakhili))."
"17","[AI-translation] Khawlah (Allah amridhie) anasimulia kwamba Nabii (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Hakika mwendo wa mwisho alioukanyaga Mola wako ni [bonde la] Wajj [Ta'if]))."
